---
// ExitProbabilitySection.astro - Section 12: Probabilistic Exit Vortex & Dual Win Condition
---

<section class="landing-section exitprob-section" id="sectionExitProb">
  <div class="section-header-block">
    <div class="section-tag">
      <span class="tag-number">07</span>
      <span class="tag-label">CONVERGENCE THRESHOLD</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-main-heading">
      THE PROBABILISTIC <span class="text-emerald-glow">EXIT</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="section-sub-heading">
      "The exit remains spatially fixed, but its quantum accessibility evolves through the persistent Qiskit circuit."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="exit-convergence-display glass-panel">
    <!-- Live Convergence Progress Meter -->
    <div class="exit-vortex-header">
      <div class="exit-portal-symbol">◉</div>
      <div class="exit-meter-meta">
        <span class="exit-meter-label">EXIT PORTAL COHERENCE</span>
        <div class="exit-large-prob" id="finalExitProb">96.4%</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Threshold Milestone Tracks -->
    <div class="threshold-track-container">
      <div class="threshold-step passed">
        <span class="step-point">20%</span>
        <span class="step-desc">Unstable</span>
      </div>
      <div class="threshold-step passed">
        <span class="step-point">45%</span>
        <span class="step-desc">Superposition</span>
      </div>
      <div class="threshold-step passed">
        <span class="step-point">70%</span>
        <span class="step-desc">Sector 01 Unlock</span>
      </div>
      <div class="threshold-step passed">
        <span class="step-point">85%</span>
        <span class="step-desc">Expert Sectors</span>
      </div>
      <div class="threshold-step active-target">
        <span class="step-point">96%</span>
        <span class="step-desc">Fully Stabilized</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Dual Win Condition Formula -->
    <div class="win-formula-box">
      <div class="formula-title">AUTHORIZED CONTAINMENT RELEASE PROTOCOL</div>
      <div class="formula-expression">
        VICTORY = [ AT_EXIT_TILE ] ∧ [ P(EXIT) ≥ THRESHOLD ] ∧ [ CHECKPOINTS_SECURED ]
      </div>
      <div class="formula-caption">
        You must physically navigate the changing maze and simultaneously manipulate the quantum state to achieve escape coherence.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .exitprob-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 24px;
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .text-emerald-glow {
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.4);
  }

  .exit-convergence-display {
    padding: 44px 36px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 0 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .exit-vortex-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .exit-portal-symbol {
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.8);
    animation: portalPulse 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes portalPulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }
  }

  .exit-meter-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .exit-meter-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .exit-large-prob {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.6);
  }

  .threshold-track-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .threshold-step {
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(10, 16, 26, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .threshold-step.passed {
    border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .threshold-step.active-target {
    background: rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--quantum-emerald);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 155, 0.2);
  }

  .step-point {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .active-target .step-point {
    color: var(--quantum-emerald);
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #64748b;
  }

  .win-formula-box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .formula-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--quantum-amber);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .formula-expression {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: clamp(13px, 1.8vw, 17px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .formula-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .exit-convergence-display {
      padding: 24px 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
